        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Wartet auf Freigabe"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Waiting to upload" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Wartet auf Upload"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "We couldn't find a face. Center your face in the oval." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Wir konnten kein Gesicht finden. Bring dein Gesicht in das Oval."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "We couldn't read this image." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Wir konnten dieses Bild nicht lesen."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "We found you" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Wir haben dich gefunden"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "We'll ask for one straight photo and two with your head turned slightly." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Wir bitten um ein gerades Foto und zwei mit leicht gedrehtem Kopf."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "We'll email you a 6-digit code. No password needed." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Wir schicken dir einen 6-stelligen Code per E-Mail. Kein Passwort nötig."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "We'll notify you when your photos are ready." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Wir benachrichtigen dich, sobald deine Fotos bereit sind."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "We'll only notify you about your searches and your events. The notification never shows photos or names." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Wir benachrichtigen dich nur zu deinen Suchen und Events. Die Benachrichtigung zeigt nie Fotos oder Namen."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "We'll open it here as soon as joining events is available in the app." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Wir öffnen ihn hier, sobald du Events in der App beitreten kannst."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "We'll withdraw your consent and delete the list of photos we matched for you. Your account stays. You'll be asked again before your next search." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Wir widerrufen deine Einwilligung und löschen die Liste deiner Treffer. Dein Konto bleibt bestehen. Vor deiner nächsten Suche fragen wir dich erneut."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Why are you reporting this photo?" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Warum meldest du dieses Foto?"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You can't join this event: its access has ended or was revoked." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Du kannst diesem Event nicht beitreten: Der Zugang ist abgelaufen oder wurde entzogen."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You don't have access to this event (any more)." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Du hast keinen Zugriff (mehr) auf dieses Event."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You don't have access to this event (any more). Its photos were removed from this device." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Du hast keinen Zugriff (mehr) auf dieses Event. Seine Fotos wurden von diesem Gerät entfernt."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You were signed out. Sign in again to continue." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Du wurdest abgemeldet. Melde dich erneut an, um fortzufahren."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You're in the queue" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Du bist in der Warteschlange"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You're offline. Check your connection and try again." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Du bist offline. Prüfe deine Verbindung und versuch es erneut."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You're signed in." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Du bist angemeldet."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You've reached the upload limit for this event." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Du hast das Upload-Limit für dieses Event erreicht."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your account and its data were deleted." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Dein Konto und seine Daten wurden gelöscht."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your earlier search is still in the queue. We'll let you know when it's done." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Deine vorherige Suche ist noch in der Warteschlange. Wir melden uns, sobald sie fertig ist."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your face isn't clearly visible. Remove sunglasses or a mask and face the light." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
